      <text x="301" y="215" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-dim font-mono text-[8.5px]">BUILTIN_PLUGINS in builtin.py — the one core module that imports a plugin</text>

      <rect x="586" y="172" width="546" height="48" class="fill-bg stroke-accent/70" stroke-width="1.3"></rect>
      <text x="859" y="189" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-ink font-mono text-[12px]">plugins/api.py</text>
      <text x="859" y="203" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-dim font-mono text-[8.5px]">Plugin · PluginManifest · PluginContext · MemorySlotPlugin</text>
      <text x="859" y="215" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-dim font-mono text-[8.5px]">PluginContext: bus · tools · hooks · config · agent_config · paths · llm · idle_llm · session</text>

